{"ID":"20240506082122-cz76nu6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240506082122-cz76nu6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082122-cz76nu6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626182853-vmud2tg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612123240-kvjtz39\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626183000-ijoj6z6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"230天鼠屎（夜明砂、蝙蝠屎）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821150324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240626182853-vmud2tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626182853-vmud2tg","updated":"20240626182908"}},{"ID":"20240626182756-dpfjubz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626182756-dpfjubz","updated":"20240626182900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"夜明砂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/夜明砂-20240626182756-biumrrt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821150040-8vybllf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821150040-8vybllf","updated":"20240821150040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 505px;","style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠-20240821150040-vd2jzic.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\" parent-style=\"width: 505px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821150001-vgy3xcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821150001-vgy3xcw","updated":"20240821150201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠2-20240626183242-s2w5bax.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 752px;","style":"width: 742px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 1-20240821150153-b84wta8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 742px;\" parent-style=\"width: 752px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821150227-mjor1dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821150227-mjor1dl","updated":"20240821150252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 2-20240821150227-i9gy10w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 564px;","style":"width: 554px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 3-20240821150252-hao2inu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 554px;\" parent-style=\"width: 564px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626183333-z981r3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626183333-z981r3c","updated":"20240821150324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠 4-20240821150324-q0lotz1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 818px;","style":"width: 808px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠3-20240626183333-n0azbue.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 808px;\" parent-style=\"width: 818px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626183000-ijoj6z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626183000-ijoj6z6","updated":"20240821150102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝙蝠-20240626183000-8z1z5f3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612123244-oy7rsb1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123244-oy7rsb1"}},{"ID":"20240612123413-fvws67z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-fvws67z","updated":"20240612123421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-1f3gs8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-1f3gs8k","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-g6nfero","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-g6nfero","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗，时痛，肠中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。一名鼠沄，一名石肝。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-t1rhzqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-t1rhzqc","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生合浦，十月十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-5l7qd4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-5l7qd4o","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案李当之云：即伏翼屎也。李云：天鼠，方言，一名仙鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-ggb6pvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-ggb6pvl","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案今本方言云：或谓之老鼠，当为天字之误也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123413-g2qo9p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123413-g2qo9p6","updated":"20240612123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上禽，中品二种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123522-xevdy5l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123522-xevdy5l"}},{"ID":"20240612123523-egpfkb2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123523-egpfkb2","updated":"20240612123527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠粪《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123523-1cd4rht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123523-1cd4rht","updated":"20240612123523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612123523-6xcb30n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123523-6xcb30n","updated":"20240612123523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶白蔹、白薇。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123523-7l54ldy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123523-7l54ldy","updated":"20240612123523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，寒。入足厥阴经血分。活血消积，散内外结气，疗肝经血分诸病。和朱砂、麝香末，治五疟。猪胆丸，米饮下，治雀盲。掺猪肝，治翳障。酒送末，下死胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123523-z9z9pwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123523-z9z9pwz","updated":"20240612123523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淘净晒干，焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123605-u6f6plk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123605-u6f6plk"}},{"ID":"20240612123606-iq9mb0b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-iq9mb0b","updated":"20240612123614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜明砂《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-v25noh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-v25noh0","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（即天鼠矢）气味辛寒。（恶白蔹白薇）主治腹中血气。破寒热积聚。治目盲障翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-1rgrbv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-1rgrbv4","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明目。（屎中淘出细砂。皆所食蚊蚋未化眼也）除惊悸。治疳有效。炒服治瘰。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-h1yr9q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-h1yr9q8","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附方青盲不见。夜明砂同糯米炒黄一两。柏叶炙一两。为末。牛胆汁和丸。梧子大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-7mir5jf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-7mir5jf","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每夜精猪和皮〔论〕夜明砂治目盲障翳。固以气类相从。至于疗儿疳。下胎毒。与本经所治腹中血气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-vpinp0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-vpinp0e","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入于者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123606-cfl1oc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123606-cfl1oc1","updated":"20240612123606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修事〕以水淘去灰土恶气。取细砂。晒干焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123629-swzy8yt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123629-swzy8yt"}},{"ID":"20240612123630-ogq0fyr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123630-ogq0fyr","updated":"20240612123634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜明砂《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123630-2p9jjdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123630-2p9jjdg","updated":"20240612123630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名天鼠矢，即蝙蝠屎。性味辛寒，入肝经血分；活血消积，治目盲障翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123538-68hh1ls","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123538-68hh1ls"}},{"ID":"20240612123539-6bxd4vw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-6bxd4vw","updated":"20240612123544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伏翼《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-ktanmlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-ktanmlo","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」蝙蝠、天鼠、仙鼠、飞鼠、夜燕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-0ok65jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-0ok65jw","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」伏翼：咸、平、无毒。天鼠屎（亦名鼠法、石肝、夜明砂、黑砂星）：辛、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-l70puon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-l70puon","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-4ldf1jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-4ldf1jo","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伏翼："}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-930s1zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-930s1zb","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、上焦发热，白昼贪眠。用五两重的蝙蝠一个（连肠、骨炙燥），云实（炒）五两、威灵仙三两，牵牛（炒）、苋实各二两，丹砂、铅丹各一两，腻粉半两，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如绿豆大。每服七丸，木通汤送下。此方名“仙乳丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-0zxblpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-0zxblpz","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、久咳上气，多年服药无效。有蝙蝠除去翅、足，烧焦，研为末，米汤送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-1g1czt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-1g1czt3","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、久疟不止。用蝙蝠一个（炙）、蛇蜕一条（烧）、蜘蛛一枚（去足、炙）、鳖甲一枚（醋炙）、麝香半钱，共研为末，加炼蜜做成丸子，如麻子大。每服五丸，温酒送下。此方名“伏翼丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-9018q6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-9018q6e","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小儿惊。用入蛰蝙蝠一个，在蝠腹中放入成块朱砂三钱，煅存性，待冷后研为末，分四次空心服下。如儿龄很小，则分五次服，都用开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-ppsbb1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-ppsbb1x","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、多年瘰疬。用蝙蝠一个、猫头一个，都撒上黑豆，烧到至骨化，研为末，敷患处。如疮已干，则调油敷涂。内服连翘汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-7b8opeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-7b8opeu","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎："}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-u4330j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-u4330j4","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、内外障翳。用夜明砂末化入猪肝内，煮食并饮汁。有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-ef25xs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-ef25xs5","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、青盲不见。用夜明砂（糯米砂黄）一两、柏叶（炙）一两，共研为末，加牛胆汁调成丸子，如梧子大。每夜睡觉时，以竹叶汤送服二十丸，至五更时，再用米汤送服二十丸，至病愈为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-17uihzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-17uihzu","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿夜盲。用夜明砂，炒过，研细，加猪胆汁调成丸子，如绿豆大。每服五丸，米汤送下。又方：用夜明砂、黄芩，等分为末，取淘米水煮猪肝的汁水每次调服半钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-p01szpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-p01szpf","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、五疟不止。用夜明砂末，每以冷茶送服一钱，立效。又方：治疟发作时，经久不愈。有夜明砂五十粒、朱砂半现金、麝香一钱，共研为末，加糯米饭做成丸子，如小豆大。发病前开水送服十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-ybb2i6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-ybb2i6b","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、咳嗽不止。用蝙蝠去翅、足，烧为末。每服一钱，饭后服，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-q3crasj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-q3crasj","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、耳出汁用。用夜明砂二钱、麝香二分，共研为末，先将患处揩干净。然后把药末敷上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123539-0bi2aye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123539-0bi2aye","updated":"20240612123539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、溃肿排脓。用夜明砂一两、桂半两、乳香一分，共研为末，加干砂糖半两，水调匀，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123512-k7t0awz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123512-k7t0awz"}},{"ID":"20240612123513-0ysmg2c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123513-0ysmg2c","updated":"20240612123517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123513-k4d8xey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123513-k4d8xey","updated":"20240612123513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑。一名鼠法，一名石肝。生合浦山谷，十月十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123446-gk5jfp8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123446-gk5jfp8"}},{"ID":"20240612123447-5krahcj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123447-5krahcj","updated":"20240612123452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123447-b5z9y0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123447-b5z9y0z","updated":"20240612123447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑 。一名鼠法，一名石肝。生合浦山谷。十月、十二月取。（恶白蔹、白薇。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123447-chkthja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123447-chkthja","updated":"20240612123447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方∶家不复用，俗不识也。唐本注云∶李氏本草云，即伏翼屎也。伏翼条中不用屎，是此明矣。《方∶言》名仙鼠，伏翼条已论也。今注一名夜明砂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123447-y7okce2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123447-y7okce2","updated":"20240612123447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简要济众治五疟方∶夜明砂，捣为散，每服一大钱，用冷茶调下，立瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123426-5vuypac","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123426-5vuypac"}},{"ID":"20240612123427-mc3gnv0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123427-mc3gnv0","updated":"20240612123432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123427-7gsmeec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123427-7gsmeec","updated":"20240612123427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，有毒。主面痈肿，皮肤说说，时痛，腹中益气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸，去面黑生令浦山谷。十月、十二月取。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123427-t6kei00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123427-t6kei00","updated":"20240612123427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶白蔹、白薇。方家不复用，俗不识也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123427-zt0svhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123427-zt0svhi","updated":"20240612123427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《李氏本草》云∶即伏翼屎也，伏翼条中名仙鼠，伏翼条以论也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123244-8odtdjm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123244-8odtdjm"}},{"ID":"20240612123402-luvriie","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123402-luvriie","updated":"20240612123407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天鼠屎《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123402-xuiydyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123402-xuiydyg","updated":"20240612123402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛寒，无毒，主治面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123402-3mggdww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123402-3mggdww","updated":"20240612123402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（天鼠《本经》名伏翼，列于上品，即蝙蝠也。天鼠屎《日华本草》名夜明砂。天鼠罕用，夜明砂常用，故录之。天鼠冬蛰夏出，昼伏夜飞，多处深山崖穴中及人家旧屋内，食蚊蚋乳石精汁。李时珍曰∶凡采得以水淘去灰土恶气，取细砂晒干焙用，其砂即蚊蚋眼也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123402-l2oe77n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123402-l2oe77n","updated":"20240612123402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝙蝠形极类鼠而飞翔空中，故曰∶天鼠。身有翼而昼伏，故曰伏翼。屎乃蚊蚋乳石之余精，气味辛寒，感阳明太阳金水之化。主治面痈肿者，面属阳明也。皮肤洗洗时痛者，皮肤属太阳也。痈肿则血气不和，阳明行身之前，而治面之痈肿，则腹中血气之病，亦可治也。皮肤洗洗，则身发寒热。皮肤时痛，则寒热积聚，太阳主通体之皮肤，而治皮肤洗洗之时痛，则自发寒热而邪积凝聚者，亦可破也。肝病则惊，心病则悸，除惊悸者，禀阳明金气，而除风木之惊，禀太阳水气，而除火热之悸也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123245-74xyxe7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123245-74xyxe7"}},{"ID":"20240612123240-o0fsits","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-o0fsits","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-buq7zfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-buq7zfo","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6ozd3oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6ozd3oc","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-s91bm52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-s91bm52","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-0dvk1n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-0dvk1n7","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蝙蝠屎、天鼠屎、檐老鼠屎"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-hwhv1ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-hwhv1ui","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-0h9t2sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-0h9t2sr","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蝙蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Vespertilio superans Thomas、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大耳蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Plecotus auritus L.或菊头蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"菊头蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rhinolophus ferrum-equinum Schreber 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粪便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可采收，以夏季为宜，去泥土杂质晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-is4rgwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-is4rgwd","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ugpxp64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ugpxp64","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 焙干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-jby3qyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-jby3qyd","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-8nebpdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-8nebpdf","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-v7z0jaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-v7z0jaf","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-rai9qw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-rai9qw1","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-w8e6deg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-w8e6deg","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-sl3yhxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-sl3yhxl","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明目，活血消积。用于夜盲症，白内障，角膜云翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-er9qvqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-er9qvqd","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-h6qzjb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-h6qzjb7","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-f0yywr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-f0yywr3","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-h2ntxaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-h2ntxaa","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夜明砂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为肝经血分药，具有清肝热、散瘀血的功效，在临床上主要用于目疾，尤以治肝热目赤、白睛溢血（即眼球膜下出血）的效果较好，能使瘀血消散；眼目清明。可用本品单味炒微焦，研细，每天一钱，分二次用开水调服；也可配合桑白皮、黄芩、赤芍、丹皮、鲜生地、白茅根等药煎汁服用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-89fbk0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-89fbk0n","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）据文献记载，前人用本品治雀目及内外障翳，常将本品研末，纳入猪肝内，煮食饮汁。此外，本品还可用于疳积及跌扑损伤、瘀血作痛等症，亦取它散血、消积的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-8ye82rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-8ye82rx","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-cu40b73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-cu40b73","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-bjda57f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-bjda57f","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-hmymuok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-hmymuok","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-gcy9uvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-gcy9uvg","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-06sgmcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-06sgmcg","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-p1rkggl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-p1rkggl","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 天鼠屎、鼠法、石肝（《本经》），黑砂星（《纲目》），檐老鼠屎（《江西中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-061pcwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-061pcwm","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-p4rd62z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-p4rd62z","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《日华子本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-9zz5dq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-9zz5dq9","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-dkz93xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-dkz93xv","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蝙蝠科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝙蝠"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等多种蝙蝠的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粪便"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年可采，以夏季为宜。到山洞中铲取，除去泥土，拣净杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-b9salyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-b9salyj","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6028i0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6028i0c","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国大部分山区均产。主产浙江、江西、江苏、广西、河南、甘肃、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-h52ck57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-h52ck57","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-3s1n46q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-3s1n46q","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 动物形态详\"蝙蝠\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-p4u542n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-p4u542n","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-kdmsyzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-kdmsyzf","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为长椭圆形颗粒，两头微尖，长5～7毫米，直径约2毫米。表面粗糙，棕褐色或灰棕色，破碎者，呈小颗粒或粉末状，在放大镜下观察，可见棕色或黄棕色有光泽的昆虫头、眼及小翅。气无，味微苦而辛。以身干无砂土、色棕褐、质轻、嚼之无砂感、并有小壳点者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6qwjoa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6qwjoa3","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-c6w0r6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-c6w0r6l","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含尿素、尿酸、胆甾醇及少量维生素A等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-4r2w3s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-4r2w3s5","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ldjwpst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ldjwpst","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，簸去泥砂，或漂洗后晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-vdzulgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-vdzulgu","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：凡采得以水淘去灰土恶气，取细砂晒干焙用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-0kg0edo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-0kg0edo","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-1fzy9mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-1fzy9mz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-s08q0qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-s08q0qa","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"厥阴肝经血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-umnxx2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-umnxx2u","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-oz33wcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-oz33wcb","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-1p0ep58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-1p0ep58","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-wu1y366","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-wu1y366","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-px9vqkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-px9vqkp","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-k5ixzd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-k5ixzd1","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-kamr3si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-kamr3si","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经集注》：\"恶白蔹、白薇。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-8th01l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-8th01l3","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《得配本草》：\"产妇禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-yiq2ccx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-yiq2ccx","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-qjrzaa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-qjrzaa0","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明日，散血消积。治青盲雀目，内外障翳，瘰疬，疳积，疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-23foox5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-23foox5","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中气血，破寒热积聚。除惊悸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-8x0qq1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-8x0qq1a","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"去面黑皯。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-je4qfxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-je4qfxh","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"酒服方寸匕，主子死腹中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-2qejnbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-2qejnbd","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"炒服治瘰疬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-bhc00n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-bhc00n9","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义》：\"合疳药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-dowxdrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-dowxdrl","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"治目盲，障翳，明目，除疟。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-kvjtz39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-kvjtz39","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-whpjnza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-whpjnza","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸，散，1～3钱。外用：研末撤或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-jyoft6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-jyoft6v","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-hk2ywqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-hk2ywqq","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治青盲：柏叶一两（微炙），夜明砂一两（以糯米炒令黄）。上药，捣罗为末，用牛胆汁拌和，丸如梧桐子大。每夜临卧时，以竹叶汤下二十丸，至五更初，以粥饮下二十丸。（《圣惠方》明目柏叶丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-vfplfpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-vfplfpz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿雀目：夜明砂炒研，猪胆汁和丸绿豆大，海米饮下五丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ebsguei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ebsguei","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治内外障翳：夜明砂末，化入猪胆内，煮食饮汁。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-4wx9z8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-4wx9z8x","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治办眼成内障：夜明砂（洗净）、当归、蝉蜕、木贼（去节）各一两。为末，黑羊肝四两，水煎烂，和丸梧子大。食后熟水下五十丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-yw08fua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-yw08fua","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治瘰疬延缠：夜明砂三钱，白蛤壳五钱（火煅）。共研细末，米饭为丸，如绿豆大。每晚服二钱，白汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-vyi6hqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-vyi6hqg","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥溃肿排脓：夜明砂一两，桂半两，乳香一分。为末，入干砂糖半两，井水调敷。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-v8m7x1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-v8m7x1m","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治一切疳毒：夜明砂五钱，入瓦瓶内，以精猪肉三两，薄切，入瓶内，水煮熟，以肉与儿食，饮其汁，取下腹中胎毒；次用生姜四两，和皮切炒，同黄连末一两，糊丸黍米大，米饮服，日三次。（《全幼心鉴》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-xt3vfa1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-xt3vfa1","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治腹中积聚，寒热：夜明砂三钱，阿魏四钱，花椒五钱，红曲六钱。俱研细末，每服二钱，清晨白汤调下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-hti6sm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-hti6sm6","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治疟发作无时，经久不瘥：蝙蝠粪五十粒，朱砂半两，麝香一分。上药，都细研，以软糯米饭和丸，如绿豆大。末发时，以暖水下十丸，（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-5ow347f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-5ow347f","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治腋下胡臭：夜明砂末，豉汁调。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-5lv0x43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-5lv0x43","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-h39xmyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-h39xmyh","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"夜明砂及蝙蝠皆厥阴肝经血分药也，能活血消积，故所治目翳盲障，疟疾疳惊，淋带，瘰疬，痈肿，皆厥阴之病也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-yc54gfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-yc54gfi","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"夜明砂，今人主明目，治目盲障翳。其味辛寒，乃入足厥阴经药，《本经》所主诸证，总属是经所发，取其辛能散内外结滞，寒能除血热气壅故也，然主疗虽多，性有专属，明目之外，余皆可略。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-h1rme3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-h1rme3p","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-sjg5koz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-sjg5koz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-366fey3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-366fey3","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：夜明砂"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-gle14i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-gle14i2","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-036ir4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-036ir4f","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yè Mínɡ Shā"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-fhfj8gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-fhfj8gl","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-gg5ij9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-gg5ij9f","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 天鼠屎、鼠法、石肝、黑砂星、檐老鼠屎"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-9gcshao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-9gcshao","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-entuj32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-entuj32","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bat Dung"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-2ewdajz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-2ewdajz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ic9ymnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ic9ymnr","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《日华子本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-5vy0kx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-5vy0kx4","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-p9cc2b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-p9cc2b1","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蝙蝠科动物蝙蝠、大管鼻蝠、普通伏翼、大耳蝠、华南大棕蝠、蹄蝠科动物大马蹄蝠及菊头蝠科动物马铁菊头蝠等的粪便。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-srfmczl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-srfmczl","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Vespertilio superans Thomas2.Murina leucogaster Milne-Edwards3.Pipistrellus abramus Temminck4.Plecotus auritus Linnaeus5.Eptesicus andersoni(Dobson)6.Hipposideros armiger Hodgson7.Phinolophus ferrumequinum Schreber"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-93otes6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-93otes6","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采，以夏季为宜。从山洞中铲取，除去泥土，拣去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6ki2k35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6ki2k35","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-53zhsiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-53zhsiy","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.栖息于屋檐、房梁、石缝、岩洞或树洞中。白天休息，黄昏或清晨活动觅食，以双翅目紫虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-x02q7is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-x02q7is","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.栖息于屋檐或古老房屋中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-n0g3lqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-n0g3lqs","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.栖息于山洞、树洞或房屋顶楼内，独居。食昆虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-7nkvycb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-7nkvycb","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.栖息于山洞、岩洞、树洞中。多为小群栖居。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-m8u3sdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-m8u3sdq","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.群栖于洞穴或废旧的坑道内。每群上百只甚至数百只。多在洞顶以后足爪钩住缝隙或突出物而作倒持姿势停息。哺乳其母体腹部长出两条皮膜带（育儿带）紧紧捆住幼仔阴谋诡计止滑脱，此为本种动物最特殊的保持适应性特征。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-181164p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-181164p","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.群栖于山洞之中，以昆虫为食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-13dz4ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-13dz4ez","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北及甘肃、福建、湖北、湖南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-47ny521","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-47ny521","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于吉林、内蒙古、福建、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-q5wmz4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-q5wmz4r","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.全国各地均有分布。4.分布于吉林、黑龙江、河北、甘肃、青海、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ye9wcu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ye9wcu8","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.分布于河北、山东、浙江、福建、广东、广西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-xprg9bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-xprg9bh","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.分布于长江流域及以南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-kkb38xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-kkb38xr","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.分布于吉林、山西、陕西、山西、陕西、山东、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-sughvch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-sughvch","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-penzs6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-penzs6l","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.蝙蝠，是一种营飞翔生活的小型兽类。较小，体长4.5-8.0cm。眼小，鼻部无鼻叶或其他衍生物。耳短而宽。由指骨末端向上至上膊骨，向后至躯体两侧后肢及尾间，有一层薄的翼膜，其上无毛。尾发达。全身呈黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-2v8p3xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-2v8p3xa","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.大管鼻蝠，体形小。鼻孔呈长管状。耳尖钝圆，耳屏尖长呈直形。翼膜宽从趾基起。第5掌骨较第4掌骨稍长。全身毛细长而柔软，毛基深褐色。体背毛灰棕色，并有灰白色细软长毛。翼膜为浅灰褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-5ok4bs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-5ok4bs6","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.普通伏翼，体形小。头骨小而宽。耳小略呈三角形，向前折转可达眼与鼻孔之间。耳屏小而圆钝，内缘凹，外缘突出。足纤小。翼膜从趾基起，距缘膜发达且呈圆弧形。尾最末端伸出股间膜。背面暗棕色，头部色较深。腹面较浅，毛基深棕色而毛端灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-yoxk28e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-yoxk28e","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.大耳蝠，体长5-8cm。耳极大，为其最着之特征。耳壳近乎卵圆形，前后缘均基突出。耳屏甚长，几为耳长之半。鼻孔朝前上方。后肢及足均纤细。尾与体等长。全身背面浅灰褐色，腹面灰白色，其毛尖灰白色，毛基黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-l64p5xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-l64p5xk","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.华南棕蝠，体形较大。前臂长5.4-5.7cm。耳较宽，近于三角形。尾端有3节椎骨而突出于股间膜外。背、腹毛基除喉和下腹稍浅而与毛端同色外，余均暗黑褐色。体前表面绝无灰黄色霜斑。下体余部淡黄灰色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6927zc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6927zc3","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.大马蹄蝠，体形较大，重41-66g，体长9.2-10.5cm。前臂长8.9-9.7cm。有复杂的鼻叶，由4部分组成；最下方为大而宽的马蹄形叶（前叶），前叶两外侧各有4个副小叶；前叶之后为横棍形的鞍状叶；其后顶叶，顶叶显着窄于前叶且分裂成4个小块。耳大，三角形，耳尖尖削，无耳屏。但有一不太突出的前外叶。额部有一很大的腺囊。第2指仅有1节掌骨，第3、第4、第5指有掌骨及2节指骨。第3、第4掌骨等长，第5掌骨短。有距，距约为胫骨长度之半。尾甚长，其长度超过体长之半，股间膜后缘呈钝角向后突出。毛被细而稠密。上体深棕色、棕褐色或褐黑色，毛基褐灰色或灰白色。 下体深棕色或褐棕色，翼膜和股间膜黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-obp5b3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-obp5b3m","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.马铁菊头蝠，前臂长5.5-6.0cm，颅2.3-2.5cm。吻部有复杂的叶状突起即鼻叶。鼻叶两侧及下方有一较宽的马蹄形肉叶；其中央有一向前突起的鞍状叶，正面呈提琴状；其侧面中央略凹，后面有一连接叶衬插着，呈宽圆形，与一顶叶相连。耳大略宽阔，耳尖部稍尖，不具耳屏。全身被细密而柔软的毛。背毛淡棕褐色，毛基色淡，呈浅棕灰色，毛尖呈棕色；腹毛为灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-3cimoa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-3cimoa0","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-pibjeeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-pibjeeb","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，本品为长椭圆形颗粒，两端微尖，长5-7mm，直径约2mm。表面略粗糙，棕褐色或灰棕色；破碎者呈小颗粒状或粉末状。放大镜下观察，可见棕色或黄棕色有光泽的昆虫头、眼及破碎的翅膜。气微或无，味微苦而微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ffic5e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ffic5e8","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-nwa3umf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-nwa3umf","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 夜明砂含尿素（urea），尿酸（uric acid），胆甾醇（cholesterol）及少量维生素（vitamin）A等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-hzp966f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-hzp966f","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-27xjoau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-27xjoau","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，簸去泥砂，或漂洗后晒干。《纲目》：凡采得以水淘去灰上恶气，取细砂晒干焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-8znrm5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-8znrm5e","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-9mht5yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-9mht5yx","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6aqw4vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6aqw4vg","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-0bgbwkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-0bgbwkz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-lyhimn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-lyhimn5","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-gcoadmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-gcoadmy","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目疾无瘀滞者及孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-o4ua1ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-o4ua1ug","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-bf2xiza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-bf2xiza","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清肝明目；散瘀消积。主青盲；雀目；目赤肿痛；白晴溢血；内外翳障；小儿疳积；瘰疬；疟疾"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-vxdzjjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-vxdzjjn","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ftoy31b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ftoy31b","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，布包，3-10g；或研末，每次1-3g。外用：适量，研末调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ehj6qq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ehj6qq7","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-f8363rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-f8363rw","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：夜明砂及蝙蝠皆厥阴肝经血分药也，能活血消积，故所治目翳盲障，疟疾疳惊，淋带，瘰疬，痈肿，皆厥阴之病也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-4h8j1nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-4h8j1nx","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：夜明砂，今人主明目，治目盲障翳。其味辛寒，乃入足厥阴经药，《本经》所主诸证，总属是经所发，取其辛能散内外结滞，寒能除血热气壅故也。然主疗虽多，性有专属，明目之外，余皆可略。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-j6nqtdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-j6nqtdn","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主面痈肿，皮肤洗洗时痛，腹中气血，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-6uo9998","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-6uo9998","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：去面黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-u5by0tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-u5by0tc","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《唐本草》：酒服方寸匕，主子死腹中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ysu7vrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ysu7vrz","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《日华子本草》：炒股治瘰疬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ltquo4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ltquo4m","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草衍义》：合疳药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-qbr4dv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-qbr4dv5","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《纲目》：治目盲，障翳，明目，除疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-ekmyssj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-ekmyssj","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612123240-cyupfq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123240-cyupfq9","updated":"20240612123240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612123647-5g5pbax","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612123647-5g5pbax"}},{"ID":"20240612123648-r0bwict","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612123648-r0bwict"}}]}